<sect1 id="EXAMPLES_DRIVERS_ECAP_EX1_APWM_1autotoc_md215">
<title>Introduction</title>
<para>This program sets up the eCAP module in APWM mode. The PWM waveform will come out on GPIO5. The frequency of PWM is configured to vary between 10Hz and 20Hz using the shadow registers to load the next period/compare values.</para>
<para>Watch Variables<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Observe the waveform on GPIO5.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</sect1>
